# Pairs with NoConcurrentLeafWrites. An interleaved reparent holds no split gate, so the persist-write gate is its only serialiser.
MODULE: SetParentIgnoresGate
TARGET: NoConcurrentLeafWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reparent write does not wait for the persist-write gate
PERTURBS: BeginSetParent

--- FIND
    /\ seed = "admitted"
    /\ gate = "free"
--- REPLACE
    /\ seed = "admitted"
    \* MUTATION: the persist-write gate is not awaited
--- END
